world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1131136#post1131136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What's the word on the Utukku?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not much. They're namedropped in Thousand Years of Night as having been residents of Ur. According to one story hook, they slowly died out as Ur itself died and its inhabitants moved elsewhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T23:59:12-07:00","id":1131142,"title":"","content":"So, are these bloodlines updated bloodlines from first edition, or entirely new bloodlines to play with? Honestly, I can live with either or. I'm also excited for Lost Clans and non-Kindred vampires, so that should be fun.<br /> <br /> Not sure if it's relevant in this thread, but has there been any word on guide to the night yet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T00:07:53-07:00","id":1131144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originall