ge\"><br /> I dunno, I'm fully willing to wait. A rushed book doesn't always mean a good book, and usually you can tell it was rushed. However, these books do sound pretty cool, so I get where your coming from. Vampire has always been my favorite line, so more books for it typically makes me happy.</div> </div> </div> </div>12 months from now to publication is <i>not</i> rushed. Heck, <i>six</i> months from now to publication wouldn't be rushed. I've worked on a rushed book, and we're talking about maybe two months for writing and development. Aaaaaand...it turned out okay, tbh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T18:51:42-07:00","id":1131555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1131541#post1131541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 12 months from now to publication is <i>not</i> rushed. Heck, <i>six</i> months from now to publication wouldn't be rushed. I've worked on a rushed book, and we're talking about maybe two months for writing and development. Aaaaaand...it turned out okay, tbh.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've never considered myself to be a writer in any sense of the word, so admittedly my perception on the matter is skewed. However, I will trust your judgement on the matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T20:48:12-07:00","id":1131590,"title":"","content":"The main issue is basically whether Onyx Path has the developer bandwidth to develop the books relatively soon or needs to wait.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T20:53:30-07:00","id":1131594,"title":"","content":"If they add more sex and violence and placed an emphasis on signature or iconic characters in the fiction people might be willing to wait 5-6 years for a single book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T21:06:59-07:00","id":1131599,"title":"","content":"Well I mean. Half-Damned and Guide to the Night still have 