lank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-20T09:58:07-08:00","id":1187880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1131233#post1131233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We did, dang how did I miss that. What ones and which page?</div> </div> </div> </div>Starting with p.28 of TYoN: Akhud, Hollow Mekhet, Julii, Pijavica. Notable change from 1e are the Julii, who get a slightly modified spread of Disciplines (though Dominate is still their signature shtick) and a completely new Clan Bane centered around the Strix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-20T10:46:10-08:00","id":1187893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shawarbaaz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1187828#post1187828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh wow finally, I hope they convert old Bloodlines instead of coming up with new ones in Spilled Blood though, in the same style of Morbus in Dark Eras Companion</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019d like to see a lot of converted bloodlines, but I hope they\u2019re not like Morbus in DEC. Having the full Clan treatment for them was fine, but having Cachexy as practically a copy and paste of the 1e discipline was extremely disappointing, and felt very at odds with 2e design.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-20T11:11:47-08:00","id":1187908,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I was so hyped for getting an official Morbus update, and then Cachexy 2.0....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-20T13:57:11-08:00","id":1187962,"title":"","content":"Happy to see the material.<br /> <br /> Worried, frankly, about the editing/organization after Thousand Years and Half-Damned.<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-20T14:25:58-08:00","id":1187972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khanwulf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1187962#post1187962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Happy to see the material.<br /> <br /> Worried, frankly, about the editing/organization after Thousand Years and Half-Damned.<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf</div> </div> </div> </div>I have an odd love hate relationship with those two books. I liked most of 1000 years of night, but the mechanics I didn't particularly care for. I disliked most of half damned except for the mechanics, mostly. Honestly, I have some high hopes for spilled blood and guide to the night because I've been wanting requiem books like these for awhile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-21T06:07:52-08:00","id":1188154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ever Professional</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1187972#post1187972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have an odd love hate relationship with those two books. I liked most of 1000 years of night, but the mechanics I didn't particularly care for. I disliked most of half damned except for the mechanics, mostly. Honestly, I have some high hopes for spilled blood and guide to the night because I've been wanting requiem books like these for awhile.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Can't really fault that. Thousand Years' fluff text is pretty good, and it's decently organized, but the mechanics are thin. Half-damned is not well organized, and I found that very important parts of mechanics were left out, scattered, or reduced to fluff. The mechanics that <i>are </i>there are good, by and large--just incomplete. Eight-ten pages more mechanics and less fluff (through editing for conciseness and reduced repetition) would have made it shine.<br /> <br /> For Spilled Blood and Guide to the Night I can only hope they are keeping things like this in mind, making the hook density high and building the mechanics around it. If Guide to the Night is a spiritual successor to Damnation City we'll be in heaven.<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-21T14:01:15-08:00","id":1188294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khanwulf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1188154#post1188154\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eight-ten pages more mechanics and less fluff (through editing for conciseness and reduced repetition) would have made it shine.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with this. I definitely remember getting halfway through the dhamphir and revenant sections, hitting a new subsection and thinking &quot;didn't we just cover this, a few pages ago?&quot; (Spoiler: Yes)<br /> <br /> I am super stoked for <i>Spilled Blood</i>. Lost Clans and weird, specific Bloodlines are some of my favorite parts of <i>Requiem</i>. I'm really hoping for a closer look at the Winter Kings (and possibly a full write-up for Berechsligost).<br /> <br /> I'm not sure what to expect from <i>Guide to the Night</i>. Probably a combined Players'/Storyteller's Guide mixed in with some <i>Damnation City</i>? I'd like it if it did some <i>Requiem</i>-specific advice for building a setting, a la Beast's <i>Building a Legend</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12970-gellydog","name":"Gellydog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12970_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-22T07:12:06-08:00","id":1188500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gellydog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1188294#post1188294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure what to expect from <i>Guide to the Night</i>. Probably a combined Players'/Storyteller's Guide mixed in with some <i>Damnation City</i>? I'd like it if it did some <i>Requiem</i>-specific advice for building a setting, a la Beast's <i>Building a Legend</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed. Particularly since VtR went from being intentionally highly insular in 1e (city-focused, with mechanics to create instant conflict if you even <i>meet</i> a new vamp!) to accepting that players are going to interact/travel outside their block (domain) and there is a nod to world-spanning vampiric influence and presences. I find it a happy middle-ground between VtR 1e and VtM's overweening meta-plot Camarilla, however giving advice on how to set up a chronicle AND how to play in it will be useful.<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T18:29:03-07:00","id":1207827,"title":"","content":"Guide to the Night is out of Redlines and in Second Draft.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gellydog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1131076-spilled-blood-and-shattered-mask-books-4-vtr?p=1188294#post1188294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure what to expect from <i>Guide to the Night</i>. Probably a combined Players'/Storyteller's Guide mixed in with some <i>Damnation City</i>? I'd like it if it did some <i>Requiem</i>-specific advice for building a setting, a la Beast's <i>Building a Legend</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like it. I guess instead of just doing separate releases of a 2nd Edition version of a Player's Guide or Storyteller's Guide, they're combining those into one book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T19:52:02-07:00","id":1221042,"title":"","content":"Sooo...<br /> <br /> &quot;Spilled Blood&quot; has shifted to Redlines, and &quot;Guide to the Night&quot; is now in Development.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T10:59:44-07:00","id":1223958,"title":"","content":"I am really excited to see what they will do with this book, though i am a little conflicted. One part of me wants to see more about the Lost clans that was updated briefly in 1001 nights, like the Julii, Akhud, and Pijavica. Julii because there my favorite clan with them being so central for vampire history and given now the prominence of the Strix is in the 2e more on them would be very fun. AKhud and Pijavica again also because they could use some more elaborated history, Akhud in particular needs to have their history fully elaborated in the context of the 2e. But while they would be nice as they were already part of 1001n that going more on them seem a little redundant, so while i want more I accept if we don't see more, after all that leaves room for brand new Lost clans which would be interesting. Anyway I hope this book lives up to my expectations, this should be fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-04T19:39:51-07:00","id":1224876,"title":"","content":"Guide to the Night's manuscript is off to nuWW for approval!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-05T10:55:42-07:00","id":1225017,"title":"","content":"So close, so so close","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T20:00:07-07:00","id":1228477,"title":"","content":"Guide to the Night is out of Manuscript Approval and now in Editing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":